// @trap memory access out of bounds
// The largest offset a memarg holds, 4294967295, is accepted and names an address far past
// the one page this module has, so the load traps rather than reading anything. The line
// before it reads the page's last byte through an offset, which is in bounds.
print(__load_u8__(0, 65535))
print(__load_u8__(0, 4294967295))
